{"title":"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> be a convex quadrilateral. Square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/7/a279cc8b342cd89126096013604c77e51c350ce8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB_1A_2B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"17\" /> is constructed such that the two vertices <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a15c38547415620c7350e89e69fefee33951cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_2,B_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"48\" height=\"16\" /> is located outside <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />. Similarly, we construct squares <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/7/8a74b64d4137680cc1f6da8a877f17e3d5cc3348.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC_1B_2C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"70\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/9/6f94de38e8d1bdd99bafbb0a57e5beb9016527e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD_1C_2D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/4/634e4d50fab713b29331d1280acf5cae0345171b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DA_1D_2A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> be the intersection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94d0633018dbc03207082be8baf7432b02c10a67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AA_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"33\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/9/e99f9f70325371de6deea41a42eb2dccde9c8802.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BB_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> be the intersection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/c/a0c236c35f96c3005246407474dd38633898db38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BB_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/f/16f46c430dadb18e2cf3e9f17f6ed9e5e1138d48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CC_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"33\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> be the intersection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/8/33869fb88069924d3791285da73cd9f47cde2412.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CC_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"33\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/b/89bfae7961de126e67e9c1f094aae6204b68dfae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DD_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"36\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> be the intersection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/7/d3760565ea96d6a5c66d40cf6f2e936256cc3405.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DD_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"36\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/0/9f0bd1bf44e9dd29cf5383c208c802b0dccb4920.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AA_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"17\" />. Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/f/f3fdf465274d91e623cc580002c0cc42fa72e36e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$KM$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> is perpendicular to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/4/ec434c6580ce358d81ec4a2a1a2e0e110dcc2b20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$LN$\" width=\"29\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/d/8bdae3486e634158da70e3693e7a596be692a494.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2a,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" />, the coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/5/425b17e4fd5640ac49baaa4efedfe105d575dafb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2b_1, 2b_2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" />, the coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/c/89c7ca21e6936222b25181cb293f7f566dec5346.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-2c,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, and the coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/9/1b9f0433761b6ac3f127293c153c0a0d0fc6dde2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2d_1, -2d_2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"18\" />, where all variables are rational and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/5/00583e7d8566fe6f6baa5feedc666067f1f3cd79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b_2, c, d_2 \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/d/e7d204cc71c65bb65ae8f2812eadcafd589ac2c9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import graph; size(9.22 cm); real lsf=0.5; pen dps=linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(10); defaultpen(dps); pen ds=black; real xmin=-10.2,xmax=10.2,ymin=-10.2,ymax=10.2;  pen cqcqcq=rgb(0.75,0.75,0.75), evevff=rgb(0.9,0.9,1), zzttqq=rgb(0.6,0.2,0);   /*grid*/ pen gs=linewidth(0.7)+cqcqcq+linetype(&quot;2 2&quot;); real gx=2,gy=2; for(real i=ceil(xmin/gx)*gx;i&lt;=floor(xmax/gx)*gx;i+=gx) draw((i,ymin)--(i,ymax),gs); for(real i=ceil(ymin/gy)*gy;i&lt;=floor(ymax/gy)*gy;i+=gy) draw((xmin,i)--(xmax,i),gs);  Label laxis; laxis.p=fontsize(10);  draw((-10,0)--(10,0),Arrows); draw((0,10)--(0,-10),Arrows); clip((xmin,ymin)--(xmin,ymax)--(xmax,ymax)--(xmax,ymin)--cycle);  pair A=(8,0), B=(2,8), C=(-6,0), D=(-4,-4); draw(A--B--C--D--A); dot(A); label(&quot;$(2a,0)$&quot;,A,NE); dot(B); label(&quot;$(2b_1,2b_2)$&quot;,B,N); dot(C); label(&quot;$(-2c,0)$&quot;,C,NW); dot(D); label(&quot;$(2d_1,-2d_2)$&quot;,D,S); [/asy]\" width=\"438\" height=\"432\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> be the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Midpoint\" title=\"Midpoint\">midpoint</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, which is point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/f/9bf9b8407279d1ad48c7925347ffe9cc44f18a46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b_1,b_2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" />.  Additionally, mark points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/3020d68ec8c6201bb57aea9dc6a2332f6ec70652.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y = (2b_1,b_2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/1/b3153356639e4817658412566e48e2dacaa1ff05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K = (x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/0/b20ffca3da01734d98d226219ed1fb1d20ba753d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z = (x,b_2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/0/2e00c86a2899afd3cf8ae47ac1c7ae09f7df4a64.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import graph; size(9.22 cm); real lsf=0.5; pen dps=linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(10); defaultpen(dps); pen ds=black; real xmin=-0.2,xmax=10.2,ymin=-0.2,ymax=10.2;  pen cqcqcq=rgb(0.75,0.75,0.75), evevff=rgb(0.9,0.9,1), zzttqq=rgb(0.6,0.2,0);   /*grid*/ pen gs=linewidth(0.7)+cqcqcq+linetype(&quot;2 2&quot;); real gx=2,gy=2; for(real i=ceil(xmin/gx)*gx;i&lt;=floor(xmax/gx)*gx;i+=gx) draw((i,ymin)--(i,ymax),gs); for(real i=ceil(ymin/gy)*gy;i&lt;=floor(ymax/gy)*gy;i+=gy) draw((xmin,i)--(xmax,i),gs);  Label laxis; laxis.p=fontsize(10);  clip((xmin,ymin)--(xmin,ymax)--(xmax,ymax)--(xmax,ymin)--cycle);  pair A=(8,0), B=(2,8); draw(A--B); dot(A); label(&quot;$(2a,0)$&quot;,A,NE); dot(B); label(&quot;$(2b_1,2b_2)$&quot;,B,N);  dot((5,4)); label(&quot;$(a+b_1,b_2)$&quot;,(5,4),NE); dot((9,7)); label(&quot;$(x,y)$&quot;,(9,7),NE); dot((2,4)); label(&quot;$(2b_1,b_2)$&quot;,(2,4),SW); dot((9,4)); label(&quot;$(x,b_2)$&quot;,(9,4),SE); [/asy]\" width=\"438\" height=\"438\" />\n</p><p>Note that since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> is the center of square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/7/a279cc8b342cd89126096013604c77e51c350ce8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB_1A_2B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/8/8588efa679719c7fd4beb14e4ba06a657eafd392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BX \\perp KX$\" width=\"87\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/5860df75efcbfe364545fc23d02a84afe00d9b48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BX = KX$\" width=\"87\" height=\"12\" />.  Additionally, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/c/c9cb2c007341655156be8c660e1575ed925228bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BY \\parallel KZ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/6/a260906aaed20f030dc06aa2096530d950f1a596.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BY \\perp YZ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/a/3aab17e2f2005ca643854186430099294ad84b85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$YZ$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> is a line, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/7/667919d2c1f8b3c444ba97d85451a1f8539dc153.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BXY + \\angle KXZ + \\angle BXK = 180^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"281\" height=\"14\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/8/8588efa679719c7fd4beb14e4ba06a657eafd392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BX \\perp KX$\" width=\"87\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/c/48cd8e095679e4b29151229fa8956a2d23c8e35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BXK = 90^\\circ$\" width=\"109\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/6/8963196434222f9bd26c65b7422e056763408890.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BXY + \\angle KXZ = 90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"189\" height=\"14\" />.  Additionally, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/2/1428cf6b8afcc03c33d3305e32892d8a9826fdff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BXY$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" /> is a right triangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee97c4a783fea2e7294d67aebcb993741e06183c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle YBX + \\angle YXB = 90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"187\" height=\"14\" />.  Rearranging and substituting results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/1/e219ff2ae76ea3ec418c8764839f1d31d5464af6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle KXZ = \\angle YBX$\" width=\"141\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nSince both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/2/ba2c9af2af77f2fbcafd872014f9e6220e611f16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BYX$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/0/0e0bbedfac9fae24224dd49a7ec2ec41a6fea556.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XZK$\" width=\"46\" height=\"12\" /> are right triangles, by AAS Congruency, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/3/a33366fc0b99882cc7a3839045349a5057700539.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BYX \\cong \\triangle XZK$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" />.  Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/8/288df8c353ebb9c2c62edad559141d152cf9dac2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BY = XZ = b_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"122\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/4828f8e6548ab7028aa364ee38e708baaccebb72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$YX = ZK = a - b_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"155\" height=\"15\" />.  From this information, the coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/5/da59a017f9034767a66a6848153ab6c5ea893ddf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b_1+b_2, b_2 + a - b_1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/3/413cf05926d14728a8a28f49d97966a405abe3c7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import graph; size(9.22 cm); real lsf=0.5; pen dps=linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(10); defaultpen(dps); pen ds=black; real xmin=-10.2,xmax=10.2,ymin=-10.2,ymax=10.2;  pen cqcqcq=rgb(0.75,0.75,0.75), evevff=rgb(0.9,0.9,1), zzttqq=rgb(0.6,0.2,0);   /*grid*/ pen gs=linewidth(0.7)+cqcqcq+linetype(&quot;2 2&quot;); real gx=2,gy=2; for(real i=ceil(xmin/gx)*gx;i&lt;=floor(xmax/gx)*gx;i+=gx) draw((i,ymin)--(i,ymax),gs); for(real i=ceil(ymin/gy)*gy;i&lt;=floor(ymax/gy)*gy;i+=gy) draw((xmin,i)--(xmax,i),gs);  Label laxis; laxis.p=fontsize(10);  draw((-10,0)--(10,0),Arrows); draw((0,10)--(0,-10),Arrows); clip((xmin,ymin)--(xmin,ymax)--(xmax,ymax)--(xmax,ymin)--cycle);  pair A=(8,0), B=(2,8), C=(-6,0), D=(-4,-4), K=(9,7), L=(-6,8), M=(-7,-3), N=(4,-8); draw(A--B--C--D--A); dot(A); label(&quot;$(2a,0)$&quot;,A,NE); dot(B); label(&quot;$(2b_1,2b_2)$&quot;,B,NE); dot(C); label(&quot;$(-2c,0)$&quot;,C,NW); dot(D); label(&quot;$(2d_1,-2d_2)$&quot;,D,S);  dot(K); label(&quot;$K$&quot;,K,NE); dot(L); label(&quot;$L$&quot;,L,NW); dot(M); label(&quot;$M$&quot;,M,SW); dot(N); label(&quot;$N$&quot;,N,SE); [/asy]\" width=\"438\" height=\"432\" />\n</p><p><br />\nBy using similar reasoning, the coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/1/48155c7e13bf47ea2bb2f8ea5db0608705f4a6ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b_1-b_2-c,b_2+b_1+c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"186\" height=\"18\" />, the coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/c/dacd4769ca0f03f75f2a90fba07969a567dc2542.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-c+d_1-d_2,-d_2-c-d_1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"221\" height=\"18\" />, and the coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/a/f3ac7da57271ff03ffd202b744bfbf5650cdace0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+d_1+d_2,d_1-d_2-a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"196\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nThe slope of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/f/f3fdf465274d91e623cc580002c0cc42fa72e36e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$KM$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/6/0b63ffb19510729f55e35c43a6058007943d83f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+b_2-b_1+c+d_2+d_1}{a+b_1+b_2+c+d_2-d_1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"195\" height=\"40\" />.  The slope of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/4/ec434c6580ce358d81ec4a2a1a2e0e110dcc2b20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$LN$\" width=\"29\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/3/ac344bd100eaf502b524875c27bfb7318ca6aa60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b_1+b_2+c+a+d_2-d_1}{b_1-b_2-c-a-d_1-d_2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"199\" height=\"42\" />.  The product of the two slopes is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/f/68fe7c5013cec00b8d48bac7d929914f156b6d6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$KM \\perp LN$\" width=\"89\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO\">2005 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki